you're carrying that out

00:43:30.710 --> 00:43:32.340
on a daily basis in a lot of ways.

00:43:32.340 --> 00:43:34.130
And I mean, the way you're
sharing that with us too

00:43:34.130 --> 00:43:37.140
so definitely towards that top piece.

00:43:37.140 --> 00:43:38.750
