00:43:59.990 --> 00:44:04.190
but I do think about when
I'm dead and it's my funeral,

00:44:04.190 --> 00:44:05.640
what do I want said about me?

00:44:05.640 --> 00:44:08.660
Like what's the impact

00:44:08.660 --> 00:44:11.000
I wanted to have on other people's lives?

00:44:11.000 --> 00:44:13.960
And am I living in accordance with that?

00:44:13.960 --> 00:44:16.260
And I think the most important thing

00:44:16.260 --> 00:44:21.260
is I want to be remembered as
somebody who saw other people,

00:44:21.540 --> 00:44:25.440
who made other people
feel like they belonged,

00:44:25.440 --> 00:44:28.380
who made other people feel less lonely

00:44:28.380 --> 00:44:31.923
and who really thought
and herald other people.

00:44:33.220 --> 00:44:36.360
And that would be a life well lived

00:44:36.360 --> 00:44:40.613
as if I was a thoughtful passenger here.

00:44:42.420 --> 00:44:45.590
So it's definitely,
that's like the big one.

00:44:45.590 --> 00:44:48.510
And then the second
thing I think about is,

00:44:48.510 --> 00:44:50.980
I want to show gratitude

00:44:50.980 --> 00:44:55.850
